{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "一次只错一点点",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 63.56,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2025 年 11 月，Balancer V2 的稳定池，被人取走了资金。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 11 月，Balancer V2 的稳定池，被人取走了资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 6.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "官方复盘估算，用户资金被盗约 9480 万美元。",
   "spoken": "官方复盘估算，用户资金被盗约 9480 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.18,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 7.271,
   "speechEnd": 12.728
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "根因，被定位在一处取整错误。",
   "spoken": "根因，被定位在一处取整错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 13.16,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 13.259,
   "speechEnd": 15.731
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "单次交换的误差很小。",
   "spoken": "单次交换的误差很小。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 16.18,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 16.273,
   "speechEnd": 17.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "攻击者把大量小额交换，串进一笔批量交换。",
   "spoken": "攻击者把大量小额交换，串进一笔批量交换。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.0,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 18.092,
   "speechEnd": 22.049
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "每一步的误差，都朝对自己有利的方向累积。",
   "spoken": "每一步的误差，都朝对自己有利的方向累积。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 22.46,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 22.559,
   "speechEnd": 25.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。金库里，每份额值 1.5 个最小资产单位。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。金库里，每份额值 1.5 个最小资产单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 26.12,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 26.12,
   "speechEnd": 31.214
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "铸造 1 份额时，合约把应收的 1.5 向下取整，只收 1 个单位。",
   "spoken": "铸造 1 份额时，合约把应收的 1.5 向下取整，只收 1 个单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 31.62,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 31.62,
   "speechEnd": 37.142
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "重复 1000 次，调用者多拿了多少？",
   "spoken": "虫复 1000 次，掉用者多拿了多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 37.6,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 37.6,
   "speechEnd": 40.828
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "大约 500 个单位。这些差额，来自其他持有人。",
   "spoken": "大约 500 个单位。这些差额，来自其他持有人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 41.54,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 41.54,
   "speechEnd": 45.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "EVM 只有整数。每一次除法，都会丢掉余数。",
   "spoken": "EVM 只有整数。每一次除法，都会丢掉余数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 46.16,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 46.26,
   "speechEnd": 50.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "丢掉的余数归谁，决定了谁能从协议里，慢慢抠出钱。",
   "spoken": "丢掉的余数归谁，决定了谁能从协议里，慢慢抠出钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 51.26,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 51.356,
   "speechEnd": 56.845
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "这一集讲三件事：数学缺陷，舍入方向，金库通胀。",
   "spoken": "这一集讲三件事：数学缺陷，舍入方向，金库通胀。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 57.32,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 57.42,
   "speechEnd": 62.193
  }
